<view class="page"><responsive-topbar title="评价晒单" subtitle="仅已完成订单可评价" bind:back="back"/><view wx:if="{{status == 'loading'}}" class="state">正在加载评价</view><view wx:elif="{{status == 'forbidden'}}" class="state"><text>需要登录</text><text>{{errorText}}</text></view><view wx:elif="{{status == 'error'}}" class="state error"><text>评价加载失败</text><text>{{errorText}}</text><button bindtap="retry">重新加载</button></view><block wx:elif="{{status == 'ready'}}"><view wx:if="{{!current}}" class="review-summary"><text class="summary-title">{{orders.length ? '待评价订单' : '当前没有可评价订单'}}</text><text>待评价 {{orders.length}}　 已提交 {{mine.length}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!current && orders.length}}" class="card"><text class="title">待评价订单</text><view wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="id" class="row review-order" bindtap="selectOrder" data-id="{{item.id}}" aria-role="button" aria-label="评价{{item.orderLabel}}" hover-class="control-pressed"><view><text>{{item.createdAt || '已完成订单'}}</text><text>{{item.orderLabel}}</text></view><text class="review-order-action">去评价 ›</text></view><text wx:if="{{!orders.length}}" class="empty">暂无待评价订单</text></view><view wx:if="{{current}}"><view class="card"><text class="title">评价商品</text><text class="order-label">{{current.orderLabel}}</text><button wx:for="{{current.items}}" wx:key="id" disabled="{{busy || item.submissionStatus == 'succeeded'}}" class="check {{item.selected ? 'is-selected' : ''}}" aria-role="checkbox" aria-checked="{{item.selected}}" bindtap="toggleItem" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view class="check-icon"><view wx:if="{{item.selected}}" class="check-icon-mark"></view></view><text>{{item.name}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.submissionStatus == 'succeeded'}}" class="submission-ok">已提交</text><text wx:elif="{{item.submissionStatus == 'unknown' || item.submissionStatus == 'failed'}}" class="submission-error">{{item.submissionError || '等待重试'}}</text></button></view><view class="card"><text class="title">{{busy ? '已填写评价（已锁定）' : '评分'}}</text><view class="rating"><button wx:for="{{[1,2,3,4,5]}}" wx:key="*this" disabled="{{busy}}" class="{{rating >= item ? 'active' : ''}}" aria-role="button" aria-label="选择 {{item}} 星评分" aria-pressed="{{rating == item}}" bindtap="setRating" data-rating="{{item}}">{{rating >= item ? '★' : '☆'}}</button></view><textarea disabled="{{busy}}" maxlength="500" value="{{content}}" bindinput="inputContent" placeholder="请填写真实使用体验"/><text class="content-count">{{content.length}} / 500</text><view class="media"><view wx:for="{{media}}" wx:key="id" class="media-item"><image src="{{item.path}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text>{{item.status == 'uploading' ? '上传中' : (item.status == 'failed' ? '上传失败' : '')}}</text><view class="media-actions"><button wx:if="{{item.status == 'failed'}}" class="media-retry" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="retryMedia" data-id="{{item.id}}">重试</button><button class="media-remove" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="removeMedia" data-id="{{item.id}}">删除</button></view></view><button class="media-add" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="chooseMedia">添加图片</button></view><view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="submit-status"><text class="title">正在提交评价</text><text>请勿重复提交；当前填写内容已经保留。</text></view><button class="review-submit" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">{{busy ? '提交中' : '提交评价'}}</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{mine.length}}" class="card"><text class="title">我的评价</text><view wx:for="{{mine}}" wx:key="_id" class="row"><view><text>{{item.content || item.reviewText}}</text><text>{{item.rating}} 星 · {{item.statusText}} · {{item.createdAt}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.status == 'rejected' && item.reviewNote}}">审核说明：{{item.reviewNote}}</text></view></view><text wx:if="{{!mine.length}}" class="empty">暂无已提交评价</text></view><view wx:if="{{!current}}" class="card review-rules"><text class="title">评价条件</text><text>订单完成并满足评价条件后，评价入口才会出现。是否可评价以订单状态为准。</text><text>评价内容是否展示，以审核结果为准。</text></view></block></view>
